power=dict(strategy='Conditional BYOG: 160 MW net-at-site modular gas generation paired with a transmission-connected 100 MW IT campus; prefer approved island-capable design, with grid import/export limits set only by studies and agreements.',gridVoltageKv=240,gridRoute='Investigate AltaLink 943L / 1054L corridor reported 1.35 km from listing; 4 x 50 MVA, 240/34.5 kV concept station. Exact connection point, circuits, redundancy and easements unselected; no right to connect.',generationRoute='16 x 10 MW net procurement target, installed 6/9/13/16 by phase; 160 MW ultimate and 140 MW with two modules unavailable. Generation CAPEX uses cost-weighted shares of approximately 47.0486% / 15.8854% / 21.1806% / 15.8854%: all CAD55m of shared gas-lateral/BESS cost is in phase 1, with remaining CAD305m allocated by 6 / 3 / 4 / 3 added modules. Remaining BOP/civils proportional allocation is approximate; actual deposits are not modeled. Add 25 MW / 25 MWh plant BESS for dynamics and independent emergency facility supply; vendor-guaranteed site performance required.',utility='AESO connection/system access; prospective transmission owner AltaLink based on nearby assets. Gas provider and firm upstream service unconfirmed; local franchise listing is not a supply offer.',constraints=['No share of Phase 1 allocation and no final BYOG qualification confirmed.','Generation-to-load ratio, tethering, export treatment, curtailment and bridging load require current process confirmation.','125 MW site peak envelope differs from 100 MW IT; annual PUE 1.20 is not a grid sizing guarantee.','Off-grid operation is a separate permitted/customer-approved scenario, not an automatic bypass.','All-electric grid-only alternative rejected as base for lack of allocated capacity; remote-generation PPA retained if a partner can offer an eligible, financeable route.','No merchant export, ancillary-service or heat-sale income underwritten.'],sourceIds=['AB01','AB02','AB03','AB04','AB05','AB11']),
